0.1091 Tc 1.4304 Tw 75.75 0 Td
(A sleeping node may have an optional low-power standby mode capable of d\etecting)Tj
0.0955 Tc 1.4734 Tw -75.75 -12 Td
(network signal transitions for the purpose of wake-up.  Any interface de\vice in the sleep state can be)Tj
0.0972 Tc 0.0256 Tw T*
(awakened by any other interface device via network activity or awakened \by its host via its interface to the)Tj
0.124 Tc -0.3082 Tw T*
(host.  There is no specified requirement for the transition from the awa\ke state to the sleep state, since this)Tj
0.0998 Tc 0.1897 Tw T*
