0.1046 Tc 2.0379 Tw -94.5 -12 Td
(the network.  The maximum amount of time from the wake-up stimulus until\ the node is capable of)Tj
0.0607 Tc 0.0964 Tw T*
(communicating is implementation specific.  A transition of the bus from \the passive state to the active state)Tj
0.1419 Tc -0.2076 Tw T*
(shall be considered a \223wake-up\224 signal to a sleeping node.  Proper\ bus bias must be supplied by all nodes)Tj
0.1083 Tc -0.1 Tw T*
