(be detected as an \223invalid\224 symbol to some devices, which will the\n ignore the current frame, if any.  The)Tj
0.1413 Tc 1.0167 Tw T*
(VPW Break symbol is a long active period \( Tv5\).  Following the break \symbol, an IFS period \(Tv6\) is)Tj
0.0768 Tc 1.2627 Tw T*
