(the system designer.  However, the total message length \(from SOF to EO\F\) shall not exceed the limit)Tj
0.1478 Tc -0.2333 Tw T*
(defined in 9.2.)Tj
0.1632 Tc 0 Tw -36 -24 Td
(7.3.7)Tj
0.2895 Tc 36 0 Td
