/T1_1 9.75 Tf
0.1371 Tc 0.0842 Tw 129.75 0 Td
(The application of this communication network is the transfer of informa\tion from)Tj
0.1298 Tc 0.6181 Tw -129.75 -12 Td
(one node of the network to one or more other nodes.  This transfer of in\formation supports both operational)Tj
0.1071 Tc 2.6467 Tw 0 -12 TD
