/T1_1 9.75 Tf
0.1312 Tc 8.7833 Tw 264.75 0 Td
(The messages sent during non-diagnostic)Tj
0.1261 Tc 1.375 Tw -264.75 -12 Td
(operations are called normal vehicle operation messages.  These normal v\ehicle operation messages are)Tj
0.1159 Tc -0.3117 Tw T*
(used for communication from a transmitter to one or more receivers acros\s this network.  The normal operation)Tj
0.1007 Tc 0.7044 Tw T*
(messages have been developed by the SAE for this communication network a\nd are defined in SAE J2178.)Tj
0.1082 Tc 0.0313 Tw T*
(SAE defined messages and the \223Reserved\224 messages of SAE J2178 shal\l remain specific to those definitions.)Tj
0.1252 Tc 0.331 Tw T*
(In SAE J2178, there is also a set of \223Reserved - Manufacturer\224 mes\sages which, if used, will have meanings)Tj
0.0958 Tc 0.0687 Tw T*
(specific to a vehicle manufacturer but are likely to be different betwee\n manufacturers.)Tj
