0.1074 Tc 0.8696 Tw -111.75 -12 Td
(network.  These diagnostic procedures may include legislated diagnostics\, industry standard diagnostics, or)Tj
0.0818 Tc 0.2077 Tw T*
(manufacturer-specific diagnostic procedures.)Tj
0.1043 Tc 3.8102 Tw 0 -24 TD
(Legislated diagnostics, and some level of voluntary industry standard di\agnostics that reference this)Tj
0.1301 Tc 0.6282 Tw 0 -12 TD
(document, should only specify procedures and frames that conform to this\ document.  SAE J1979 and SAE)Tj
0.1357 Tc 1.7007 Tw T*
