0.099 Tc 1.6464 Tw -171 -12 Td
(standby state is a common occurrence in vehicle multiplex systems.  In t\he context of this document the)Tj
0.1381 Tc -0.1895 Tw T*
(Session Layer controls the transitions between the operating and the sta\ndby states.)Tj
0.0542 Tc 0.2353 Tw 0 -24 TD
(Two perspectives are used to define the session layer:)Tj
-0.3158 Tc 0 Tw 18 -24 Td
