0.1182 Tc 3.0963 Tw (The arbitration resolution described previously concerns all the symbols\ and bits)Tj
0.0897 Tc -0.0252 Tw -70.5 -12 Td
(between the SOF and the EOF including, in the case of an in-frame respon\se, all the symbols and bits of the)Tj
0.103 Tc 0.0365 Tw T*
(in-frame response.  In other words, arbitration acts throughout the fram\e.)Tj
