(The data bus can be in one of two valid states  active or passive.)Tj
0.1023 Tc 0.5622 Tw -183.75 -12 Td
(For clarity in the following sections, a rising edge is a transition fro\m the passive to active state and a falling)Tj
0.1395 Tc -0.3 Tw T*
(edge is a transition from the active to the passive state.)Tj
0.1272 Tc 2.1123 Tw 0 -24 TD
(There are two methods of bit encoding specified in this document, Pulse \Width Modulation \(PWM\) and)Tj
0.1038 Tc 0.5857 Tw 0 -12 TD
