(It is the intent of this network to interconnect different electronic mo\dules on the vehicle using an)Tj
0.1057 Tc 0.0588 Tw -47.25 -12 Td
(\223Open Architecture\224 approach.  An open architecture network is one\ in which the addition or deletion of one or)Tj
0.104 Tc 0.0124 Tw 0 -12 TD
(more modules \(data nodes\) has minimal hardware and/or software impact \on the remaining modules.)Tj
0.1239 Tc 0.342 Tw 0 -24 TD
