0.0915 Tc 0.898 Tw (Data bus topology is the map of physical connections of the data bus nod\es to the)Tj
0.0949 Tc 0.2661 Tw -52.5 -12 Td
(data bus.  It includes all nodes and data buses involved in the data bus\ integration of the vehicle.  A single-)Tj
0.1054 Tc 0.1841 Tw T*
(level bus topology, the simplest bus topology, is currently being used i\n several automotive applications.  In)Tj
0.1197 Tc 3.0698 Tw T*
(a single-level bus topology, all nodes are interconnected via the same d\ata bus.  The redundancy)Tj
0.1383 Tc -0.3845 Tw T*
(requirements of a particular application may require a single-level topo\logy to be implemented using multiple)Tj
