/T1_1 9.75 Tf
0.1199 Tc 3.5863 Tw 155.25 0 Td
(A system whereby data \(e.g., parametric data values\) is transferred)Tj
0.1399 Tc 1.6496 Tw -155.25 -12 Td
(between nodes to eliminate redundant sensors and other system elements. \ The nodes in this form of a)Tj
0.1188 Tc -0.2512 Tw T*
(multiplex system typically already existed as stand-alone modules in a c\onventionally wired vehicle.  A Class B)Tj
0.1296 Tc -0.2567 Tw T*
(network shall also be capable of performing Class A functions.)Tj
/T1_0 9.75 Tf
0.2325 Tc 0 Tw -27 -24 Td
(3.5)Tj
0.1291 Tc -0.0896 Tw 27 0 Td
(Class C Data Communications\227)Tj
/T1_1 9.75 Tf
0.0954 Tc 0.1191 Tw 155.25 0 Td
(A system whereby high data rate signals typically associated with real-t\ime)Tj
0.1021 Tc 2.1561 Tw -155.25 -12 Td
(control systems, such as engine controls and anti-lock brakes, are sent \over the signal bus to facilitate)Tj
0.0924 Tc 0.0721 Tw T*
(distributed control and to further reduce vehicle wiring.  A Class C net\work shall also be capable of performing)Tj
0.13 Tc -0.2905 Tw T*
(Class A and Class B functions.)Tj
/T1_0 9.75 Tf
0.2325 Tc 0 Tw -27 -24 Td
(3.6)Tj
0.1705 Tc 0.119 Tw 27 0 Td
(Dominant Bit\227)Tj
/T1_1 9.75 Tf
0.1141 Tc 0.9695 Tw 72 0 Td
(A bit which wins arbitration when contending for the bus. For SAE J1850,\ a logic \2230\224 is the)Tj
0.0743 Tc -0.5348 Tw -72 -12 Td
(dominant bit.)Tj
